*.egg-info
__pycache__
.env

# pixi environments (pixi.lock is committed)
.pixi/

# Search results and downloads contain PHI (MRNs, accession numbers,
# birthdates, DICOM). Never commit them.
accessions.csv
*.csv
output*/
*.zip

# The crosswalk maps every pseudonym in a cohort back to a real patient,
# which makes it the most sensitive file this package writes. Covered by
# *.csv above; named again here so relaxing that rule cannot expose it.
*crosswalk*.csv

# Patient spreadsheets, and bulk cohort downloads. A cohort tree's folder
# names are pseudonyms now, so the names themselves are safe -- it stays
# ignored because it is gigabytes of DICOM, not because it is PHI.
*.xlsx
*.xls
cohort/
cohort-*/
tmp/